			title: "Wood and Stone"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3BB2DAC36CB01A7B"]
			description: [
				"Rubber trees grow in forests, jungles and swamps, and their logs often drop &6sticky resin&r when you break them. It goes into rubber, the first circuit boards and torches."
				"Collect some by hand for now. The steam greenhouse takes over the resin business later."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:sticky_resin"
			id: "5DCCA11440887F89"
			rewards: [{ id: "60A4085073C91D4B", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 16L, id: "159456B66255575F", item: "gtceu:sticky_resin", type: "item" }]
			title: "Sticky Resin"
			x: 4.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3BB2DAC36CB01A7B"]
			description: [
				"No vanilla ores spawn here. GregTech veins mix several metals, and a raw ore's EMI page shows its vein and depth."
				"Claim Arrival's &6Field Prospector&r. Right-click to mark veins within sixteen chunks, without charging. Open your map and enable Ore Veins. It surveys generated terrain, not unexplored ground. Surface rocks still tell you what's underneath."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:prospector.hv"
			id: "345C4D73090CB5E2"
			rewards: [{ id: "2489A56E439E1302", type: "xp", xp: 10 }]
