		{
			dependencies: ["436EF55FE0284C3E"]
			description: [
				"GregTech tools stay in the crafting grid and come out a little more worn each time. The hammer comes first. Set it above ingots and you get a plate, and get used to plates, because most of what you make from here on wants some."
