		{
			dependencies: ["047B55ED9C952BC9"]
			description: [
				"Both come from the copper-tin vein, which runs from the caves up into the hills: chalcopyrite for copper, cassiterite for tin. There's also a cassiterite vein that's nearly all tin. The raw ores smelt straight into ingots."
				"Tooltips carry the formula, and the Sn on tin is Latin, not a typo."
			]
